    <li>subject_story->加深了[ANYPAWN_possessive]对仪式献祭的理解</li>
    <li>subject_story->被Ix大学任命为心灵史教授</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->举行高级心灵仪式</li>
  </AdvancedPsychicRituals.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  
  <!-- EN: atmospheric heater -->
  <AtmosphericHeater.label>大气升温器</AtmosphericHeater.label>
  <!-- EN: Build bioferrite-powered heaters that produce enough heat to warm an entire region. -->
  <AtmosphericHeater.description>解锁建造消耗活铁运作的「大气升温器」，产生的热量足以使整个地区的温度上升。</AtmosphericHeater.description>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>subject->生物铁加热</li>
    <li>subject_story->升级了老旧的地热装置</li>
    <li>subject_story->研究了生物金属的热输出</li>
    <li>subject_story->探究了超凡能量储存那不可思议的容量</li>
    <li>subject_story->考察了人口稠密冰世界上的火炕系统</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->用生物铁加热</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->建造以生物铁为燃料的加热器</li>
  -->
  <AtmosphericHeater.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>subject->使用活铁进行加热</li>
    <li>subject_story->升级了古老的地热发电站</li>
    <li>subject_story->调查了生物金属的热产出</li>
    <li>subject_story->研究了超凡科技的超大容量储能技术</li>
    <li>subject_story->研究了人口密集的冰雪世界上的热坑系统</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->使用活铁进行加热</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->建造消耗活铁运作的升温器</li>
  </AtmosphericHeater.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  
  <!-- EN: void provocation -->
  <BasicPsychicRituals.label>虚空扰动</BasicPsychicRituals.label>
  <!-- EN: Build a psychic ritual spot and perform psychic rituals. Use the void provocation ritual to discover new entities. -->
  <BasicPsychicRituals.description>解锁建造心灵仪式举办点，用于进行心灵仪式。使用虚空扰动仪式发现新的实体。</BasicPsychicRituals.description>
