    <li>subject_story->与沙漠石柱顶上的暗黑超凡碎片进行了交流</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->进行心灵仪式</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->建立仪式举办点</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->刺激虚空实体</li>
  </BasicPsychicRituals.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  
  <!-- EN: bioferrite extraction -->
  <BioferriteExtraction.label>活铁提取</BioferriteExtraction.label>
  <!-- EN: Extract bioferrite directly from captured entities. Use it to craft weapons and apparel at a crafting spot or bioferrite shaper. -->
  <BioferriteExtraction.description>通过手术方式直接从被捕获的实体身上提取活铁。这种材料可用于在手工加工点或活铁塑造台处制作武器与衣物。</BioferriteExtraction.description>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>subject->生物铁提取</li>
    <li>subject_story->从一份急速突变的血肉样本中提取出一种有机化合物</li>
    <li>subject_story->剥下一棵先驱树的树皮并熬煮其血肉</li>
    <li>subject_story->调查了关于某种超凡现象的报告</li>
    <li>subject_story->发现了一种新型有机金属</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->提取生物铁</li>
  -->
  <BioferriteExtraction.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>subject->活铁提取</li>
    <li>subject_story->从迅速突变的血肉样本中提取某种有机化合物</li>
    <li>subject_story->剥下并沸煮厄兆噬树的血肉</li>
    <li>subject_story->某种超凡现象的调查报告</li>
    <li>subject_story->发现了某种珍奇的有机金属</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->提取活铁</li>
  </BioferriteExtraction.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  
  <!-- EN: bioferrite generator -->
  <BioferriteGenerator.label>活铁发电机</BioferriteGenerator.label>
  <!-- EN: Build power generators that burn bioferrite as a fuel. -->
  <BioferriteGenerator.description>建造燃烧活铁作为燃料的发电机。</BioferriteGenerator.description>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>subject->生物铁发电</li>
    <li>subject_story->接受了新型能源使用的训练</li>
    <li>subject_story->探索了金属基与纤维基燃料的用途</li>
    <li>subject_story->发现自己热爱火焰与一切可燃之物</li>
    <li>subject_story->担任技师，维护轨道能源系统</li>
    <li>subject_story->把一个星系里的野生动物拆解炼成燃料</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->建造生物铁驱动的发电机</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->用生物铁为发电机供能</li>
  -->
  <BioferriteGenerator.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>subject->活铁发电</li>
    <li>subject_story->接受了使用新动力源的训练</li>
    <li>subject_story->探索了金属与纤维燃料的运用</li>
    <li>subject_story->发现了自己对火焰以及燃烧物的热爱</li>
    <li>subject_story->担任技术员，负责维护轨道能源系统</li>
    <li>subject_story->从野生动物身上提取了可用作燃料的成分</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->建造活铁发电机</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->使用活铁为发电机提供动力</li>
  </BioferriteGenerator.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  
  <!-- EN: bioferrite harvester -->
  <BioferriteHarvesting.label>活铁采集</BioferriteHarvesting.label>
  <!-- EN: Build bioferrite harvesters that automatically extract bioferrite from captured entities. Produces more bioferrite than manual extraction. -->
  <BioferriteHarvesting.description>解锁建造「活铁采集器」，可以自动从被捕获的实体身上采集活铁。比手术提取更有效率，产出的活铁也更多。</BioferriteHarvesting.description>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>subject->生物铁</li>
    <li>subject_story->研究了一种奇异的类金属纤维物质</li>
    <li>subject_story->解剖了一具食尸鬼般的尸体</li>
    <li>subject_story->发现了一批有机金属</li>
    <li>subject_story->观察了被奇异金属侵染的野生动物</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->采收生物铁</li>
  -->
  <BioferriteHarvesting.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>subject->活铁</li>
    <li>subject_story->调查了一种奇特的金属样纤维物质</li>
    <li>subject_story->对一具可怕的尸体进行了活体解剖</li>
    <li>subject_story->发现了一堆有机金属</li>
    <li>subject_story->发现了奇怪的野生动物，似乎被金属感染了</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->采集活铁</li>
  </BioferriteHarvesting.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  
