  <!-- EN: bliss lobotomy -->
  <BlissLobotomy.label>极乐切脑</BlissLobotomy.label>
  <!-- EN: Perform a surgery that lobotomizes a person, making them happier while rendering them incapable of intellectual and skilled labor. -->
  <BlissLobotomy.description>对病人进行脑叶切除手术，使其变得无忧无虑，但同时也会丧失从事智识和专业工作的能力。</BlissLobotomy.description>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>subject->脑白质切除</li>
    <li>subject_story->最终因思想罪被国家施以脑白质切除</li>
    <li>subject_story->使埃尔多夫实验的少数幸存者康复</li>
    <li>subject_story->拜师学习脑外科与理发</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->施行脑白质切除</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->切除脑组织</li>
  -->
  <BlissLobotomy.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>subject->极乐切脑</li>
    <li>subject_story->最终因思想反动而被切除脑叶</li>
    <li>subject_story->为埃尔多夫实验的少数幸存者提供了康复治疗</li>
    <li>subject_story->拥有脑外科医生以及理发师的学徒身份</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->进行极乐切脑</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->刺激脑组织</li>
  </BlissLobotomy.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  
  <!-- EN: blood rain -->
  <BloodRain.label>血怒之雨</BloodRain.label>
  <!-- EN: Perform a psychic ritual which causes blood-like psychofluid to fall from the sky. Anyone caught outside will soon be driven into a berserk rage. -->
  <BloodRain.description>进行心灵仪式，使血液般的心灵流体从天而降。任何暴露其中的人心头都将泛起一股无名怒火，最终陷入狂暴。</BloodRain.description>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>subject->血雨</li>
    <li>subject_story->研究了关于有机降水的古代自然神论神话</li>
    <li>subject_story->研究了易怒者的神经通路</li>
    <li>subject_story->在超凡世界伊克斯采样了灵液流</li>
    <li>subject_story->被灵液雨淋过，从此填满无法抑制的怒火</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->使其降下血雨</li>
  -->
  <BloodRain.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>subject->血怒之雨</li>
    <li>subject_story->调查过古代关于有机物降雨的神话</li>
    <li>subject_story->调查过狂躁症患者的神经回路</li>
    <li>subject_story->对Ix飞升世界的心灵流体进行了采样</li>
    <li>subject_story->被心灵流体淋湿，内心充满了难以控制的愤怒</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->召唤血怒之雨</li>
  </BloodRain.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  
  <!-- EN: brainwipe -->
  <Brainwipe.label>洗脑</Brainwipe.label>
  <!-- EN: Perform a psychic ritual which erases much of a person's episodic memories. Traumatic events will be forgotten. Resistant prisoners will become easier to recruit. Allows recruiting unwaveringly loyal prisoners. -->
  <Brainwipe.description>进行心灵仪式，消除一个人的大部分情节记忆。创伤性事件将被遗忘。拒不配合的囚犯也会变得更容易被招募。</Brainwipe.description>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>subject->记忆抹除</li>
    <li>subject_story->研究了发作性失忆的案例</li>
    <li>subject_story->在一家收治脑损伤幸存者的诊所工作</li>
    <li>subject_story->研究了失忆者的神经通路</li>
    <li>subject_story->遗忘战争后管理过一处洗脑设施</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->抹去对象的记忆</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->施行抹除对象记忆的仪式</li>
  -->
  <Brainwipe.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>subject->意识抹除</li>
    <li>subject_story->研究过偶发失忆症病例</li>
    <li>subject_story->曾在一家专为脑损伤幸存者服务的诊所工作</li>
    <li>subject_story->研究过失忆症患者的神经回路</li>
    <li>subject_story->在被遗忘的战争结束后曾管理过一座洗脑设施</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->抹除受试对象的意识</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->进行心灵仪式以抹除受试对象的意识</li>
  </Brainwipe.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  
  <!-- EN: chronophagy -->
  <Chronophagy.label>时间吞噬</Chronophagy.label>
  <!-- EN: Perform a psychic ritual that causes a target to age rapidly. The ritual invoker will become younger in the process. The target will suffer brain damage as a result, which may be lethal for elderly targets. -->
  <Chronophagy.description>进行能让目标迅速衰老的心灵仪式。在此过程中，仪式发起者会变得更年轻。而目标也会因此受到脑损伤，这对老年目标来说可能是致命的。</Chronophagy.description>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>subject->食时术</li>
    <li>subject_story->研究了与年龄相关的退化</li>
    <li>subject_story->以破坏性方式把一个生物的健康结构复制到另一个生物身上</li>
    <li>subject_story->提出了关于注入超凡之物所能开启的各种仪式的理论</li>
    <li>subject_story->观摩过闪耀世界诊所里昂贵的延寿疗法</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->窃取青春</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->召引食时术</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->施行食时仪式</li>
  -->
  <Chronophagy.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>subject->时间吞噬</li>
    <li>subject_story->研究过与年龄相关的退化症</li>
    <li>subject_story->曾破坏性地将健康组织从一个生物体复制到另一个生物体</li>
    <li>subject_story->曾将充满超凡科技的各种仪式理论化</li>
    <li>subject_story->曾在上流社会的诊所里观察过大量延寿疗法</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->窃取青春</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->进行时间吞噬</li>
    <li>subject_gerund->进行时间吞噬仪式</li>
  </Chronophagy.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  
  <!-- EN: deadlife dust -->
  <DeadlifeDust.label>死灵尘</DeadlifeDust.label>
  <!-- EN: Craft devices that produce clouds of microscopic archites. The archites can reanimate corpses to produce deadly shamblers that will only attack your enemies. -->
  <DeadlifeDust.description>解锁制作能散布超凡微械的设备。超凡微械可以让尸体重获行动能力，将它们转化为只会攻击敌人的致命蹒跚怪。</DeadlifeDust.description>
