  <!-- EN: death refusal -->
  <DeathRefusal.label>死亡回避</DeathRefusal.label>
  <!-- EN: Perform a psychic ritual which grants death refusal to an individual, allowing them to self-resurrect once after dying. -->
  <DeathRefusal.description>进行心灵仪式，赋予某人“死亡回避”的能力，能够在死后复活一次。</DeathRefusal.description>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>subject->拒死祈唤</li>
    <li>subject_story->调查了关于不可能生还的传说</li>
